"Welder busy welding, equipped with protective gear and a welding helmet "
"displaying the 'Fabriq' company logo."
msgstr ""

#. module: metal_fabricator
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:metal_fabricator.view_page_home
msgid ""
"Welder in action, busy welding large metal components in a workshop with a "
"shower of sparks."
